: \"There are several methods to remove forehead pimples overnight. One method is to apply lemon juice or a paste made from a teaspoon of cinnamon powder and a tablespoon of lemon juice. Apply these on the pimples and leave them overnight, washing them off in the morning with warm water. You can also apply a natural mask and leave it overnight, rinsing it off in the morning. However, before you do any of these, make sure to remove any makeup from your forehead with cold cream and always use clean cotton swabs or clean fingers to apply these treatments.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "seed": 69410, "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1}
