\"original_answer\": \"At least 147 people have been killed, and many more injured, in a terrorist attack on Garissa University College, in Kenya. The attack was carried out by members of Al-Shabaab, an Islamist extremist group. The attackers targeted a Christian prayer service, before moving through the campus, killing non-Muslims and taking hostages. Witnesses have described the attackers forcing students to lie down before shooting them in the head. Some students were beheaded. The attackers then killed the remaining hostages. One student, Hellen Titus, survived by smearing herself in the blood of another victim to make it look as though she was dead. The bodies of the attackers were found still clutching their weapons.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "seed": 69410, "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1}
