ain to prevent it.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
