 popular restaurant located at 38 W Victoria St, Ste 109 in Santa Barbara, CA. Known for its unique blend of Comfort Food, Asian Fusion, Chinese, Tapas/Small Plates, Noodles, and Thai cuisines, it has received an average rating of 4.5 stars. The restaurant offers free Wi-Fi and outdoor seating, and is suitable for groups. Despite not accepting reservations, it also caters to take-out orders. Customers praise the restaurant for its delicious Thai food, highlighting dishes such as the Northern Thailand Curry Noodle, Bangkok noodles, and pan-fried pancit noodles. The establishment is also noted for its trendy and casual ambience, and its location within Santa Barbara's public market. It operates from 11 am to 9 pm from Tuesday to Sunday.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "seed": 69410, "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1}
