\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Stopped in for a quick flight. Lots of choices for IPAs. We had the Sabado Tarde (sweet and light), platonic IPA (light IPA flavor - easy drinking), greatland special (smooth bitter), Gtown (grapefruit, my favorite). Lots of people watching on the front patio.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"M. Special Brewing Company is a versatile establishment located at 634 State St, Santa Barbara, CA. It operates under several categories including Breweries, American (New), Arts & Entertainment, Music Venues, Restaurants, Brewpubs, Food, and Nightlife. The business operates from 16:00 to 21:00 during weekdays and extends its hours from 12:00 to 22:00 on Saturdays and 21:00 on Sundays. The company does not provide valet services, garage, street parking or validated parking but offers outdoor seating and take-out facilities. Patrons of M. Special Brewing Company are particularly fond of the brewery, citing it as the \\\"coolest, chillest brewery on the strip\\\" with a \\\"solid variety for tastes of all types.\\\" Customers also appreciate the great atmosphere and the wide variety of IPAs available. The business has an overall rating of 3.5 stars.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
