acially and ethnically inclusive cast that includes Dwayne 'The Rock' Johnson, Christopher 'Ludacris' Bridges, Tyrese Gibson, Michelle Rodriguez, Tony Jaa, Djimon Hounsou, and the late Paul Walker. The film also made sure to hire diverse extras for key scenes filmed in Abu Dhabi and Dubai. The Fast and Furious films have been praised for their focus on diversity and their representation of race as a fact of life, rather than a social issue.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
