}\", \"original_answer\": \"Furious 7 star Vin Diesel has predicted that his latest film will win an Oscar for Best Picture, due to its ethnic diversity. This follows a controversy earlier this year regarding the lack of diversity in the Oscar nominations. The Fast and Furious franchise is known for its ethnically diverse cast. Furious 7 is no different, with a racially and ethnically inclusive cast that includes Dwayne 'The Rock' Johnson, Christopher 'Ludacris' Bridges, Tyrese Gibson, Michelle Rodriguez, Tony Jaa, Djimon Hounsou, and the late Paul Walker. The film also made sure to hire diverse extras for key scenes filmed in Abu Dhabi and Dubai. The Fast and Furious films have been praised for their focus on diversity and their representation of race as a fact of life, rather than a social issue.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "seed": 69410, "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1}
